      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Mosk stared at the apple for a long time, as if remembering a season long past. Then he stood up, tied his vest, and stepped onto the first stair without a word. The wooden steps groaned under his weight, leading them down into the belly of the great hollow tree where the air smelled of damp earth and ancient secrets."
    }
  ],
  "active_scene_id": "s3"
}

